{title: No Longer Slaves (FJ_109_en)}
{song_number: 109}
{language: en}
{tempo: 74}
{artist: Brian Johnson, Joel Case und Jonathan David Helser; Deutsch: Klaus Osigus}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[E]You unravel me with a melody.
[A]You surround me with a [B]song [E]of deliverance
from my enemies till all [A]my fears [B]are gone. [E]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[A]I'm no longer a [B]slave to fear;
[E]I [C#m]am a [B]child of God. [E]
[A]I'm no longer a [B]slave to fear;
[E]I [C#m]am a [B]child of God. [C#m][B][E]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[E]From my Mother's womb You have chosen me;
[A]Love has called my name. [B]I've been born [E]again
into Your family; [A]Your blood flows [B]through my veins. [E]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[A]I'm no longer a [B]slave to fear;
[E]I [C#m]am a [B]child of God. [E]
[A]I'm no longer a [B]slave to fear;
[E]I [C#m]am a [B]child of God. [C#m][B][E]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[C#m]You split the sea so [B]I could walk [E]right through [A]it.
[C#m]My fears were drowned [B]in perfect [E]love. [A]
[C#m]You rescued me so [B]I could [E]stand and [G#m]sing:
[A]I am a [B]child of God. [E]
[A]I am a [B]child of God. [E]
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus}
[A]I'm no longer a [B]slave to fear;
[E]I [C#m]am a [B]child of God. [E]
[A]I'm no longer a [B]slave to fear;
[E]I [C#m]am a [B]child of God. [C#m][B][E]
{end_of_chorus}
